<section class="how-to-use" id="how-to-use">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">三步轻松养发，懒人也能坚持</h2>
    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-img"><img src="{{ 'slide9_img7_30.png' | asset_url }}" alt="起泡"></div>
        <div class="step-number">01</div>
        <h3>起泡</h3>
        <p>手心打湿后揉搓起泡，泡沫更细腻。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-img"><img src="{{ 'slide9_img8_31.png' | asset_url }}" alt="按摩"></div>
        <div class="step-number">02</div>
        <h3>按摩</h3>
        <p>泡沫上头皮，以指腹轻柔打圈 3-5 分钟。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-img"><img src="{{ 'slide9_img9_32.png' | asset_url }}" alt="冲洗"></div>
        <div class="step-number">03</div>
        <h3>冲洗</h3>
        <p>温水彻底冲净，保持头皮轻盈状态。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tips-section">
      <h3 class="tips-title">💡 正确按摩，效果加倍</h3>
      <div class="tips-grid">
        <div class="tip-card">
          <div class="tip-icon">📅</div>
          <h4>按需调整频率</h4>
          <p>油性头皮可隔天使用一次，中性或干性头皮建议每周2-3次，维持头皮健康状态。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-card">
          <div class="tip-icon">👆</div>
          <h4>强调指腹按摩</h4>
          <p>用指腹进行打圈按摩，而不是用指甲用力抓挠，能有效避免损伤头皮屏障。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-card">
          <div class="tip-icon">⏱️</div>
          <h4>保证充足时长</h4>
          <p>每次按摩时间建议在3分钟以上，让产品有效成分充分渗透并被头皮吸收。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.how-to-use { padding: 80px 0; background: #f8f9f0; }
.steps-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
  gap: 28px;
  margin-bottom: 60px;
}
.step-card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 36px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  transition: transform 0.3s;
}
.step-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
.step-img { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.step-img img { width: 160px; height: 160px; border-radius: 16px; object-fit: cover; }
.step-number {
  font-size: 36px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #4a7c3f;
  opacity: 0.3;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.step-card h3 { font-size: 20px; color: #2d4a2a; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.step-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; }

.tips-section {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 40px 32px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
}
.tips-title {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 22px;
  color: #2d4a2a;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.tips-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
  gap: 24px;
}
.tip-card {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: #f8f9f0;
}
.tip-icon { font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.tip-card h4 { font-size: 16px; color: #2d4a2a; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.tip-card p { font-size: 13px; color: #666; line-height: 1.7; }
</style>

